1. KQL Investigation Queries
Query 1: Filter Failing Requests with Error Details

requests
 | where success == false
 | project timestamp, name, resultCode, duration, cloud_RoleName, operation_Id
 | order by timestamp asc

Query 2: Correlate Requests with Unhandled C# Exceptions via Join

requests
 | where success == false
 | join kind=inner (
 exceptions
 | where handledAt != "UserCode"
 | project operation_Id, type, method, message, handledAt
 ) on operation_Id
 | project operation_Id, name, resultCode, type, method, message

Query 3: Dependency Failure Rate & Duration Mapping

dependencies
 | summarize TotalCalls = count(), FailedCalls = countif(success == false), FailureRate = round(100.0 * countif(success == false) / count(), 2), AvgDuration = round(avg(duration), 2) by target, type
 | extend OperationalHealth = iff(FailureRate > 0, "Unhealthy", "Healthy")
 | order by FailureRate desc

Query 4: Time-Series Error Render

requests
 | where success == false
 | summarize ErrorCount = count() by bin(timestamp, 1m)
 | render timechart

